The `RemoveWithLockAsync` method achieves the same functionality as `RemoveWithLock`, but it uses the asynchronous `WriterLockAsync` method to acquire the writer lock in an asynchronous manner. This allows for non-blocking execution of the method while ensuring thread safety during the removal operation.

